  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of the implementation of the National Use Zoning project in Bhutan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support the Bhutan National Land Commission and the Technical Working Group in implementing the National Land Use Zoning Project (NLUZ).The ultimate aim is to enable the establishment of a harmonized national land use system in Bhutan. This will lead to a solid basis for establishing land use ordinances and enforcement.It will also be an incentive for Bhutan to make optimal, sensible and sustainable use of the limited land resources.</narrative>
  </description>
